:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Ryoga Hibiki (Pig) (Uber Rare Cat)|Ryoga Hibiki (Pig)]].''
'''Ryoga Hibiki''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ryoga Hibiki
|image = E 544.png
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,990¢
|appearance = [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
A mid-ranged attacker with somewhat low attack power (but very low DPS) and a 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] your cats.

==Strategy==
This enemy has very low DPS, so you can use units that can tank his attacks and/or units that can outrange his [[Omni Strike]].

